## Third-party material

Raw OpenAIRE API responses stored in `results/mcp_calls*.jsonl` are metadata
retrieved from the OpenAIRE Research Graph and remain subject to OpenAIRE's own
terms of use. They are reproduced verbatim so the selection step can be audited.

No market data is included in this repository under any licence: the underlying
bars come from a commercial feed that forbids redistribution.
